{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Now Hiring: Daytime Security Staff for Apartment Complex&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Working hours: 8:00 AM \u2013 6:00 PM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trial period: 10 days</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are three essential rules for security staff:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Always greet the residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Always have guests write their real name in the visitor log.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Never speak to the woman in white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pomegranate Housing Complex</strong> is a first-person horror adventure game where you work as a daytime security guard at a cursed apartment for 10 days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story branches depending on your interactions with residents and visitors\u2014and whether you obey the rules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ten days of time-limited patrols</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game time advances one hour every 3 real-world minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Time stops during major events.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll move between the guard room and the apartment building, carrying out tasks such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Guard Room:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755820/extras/screenshot0003.png?t=1748044755\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monitoring surveillance camera footage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Checking the visitor log and resident list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Greeting residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handling phone calls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Apartment Building:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755820/extras/007.gif?t=1748044755\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Patrolling each floor and the rooftop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responding to unusual occurrences</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Breaking the rules will corrupt the ordinary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several rules govern your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breaking them increases your &quot;Haunting Level.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If it rises too high, you'll lose control and face consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But some events... can only be witnessed if the haunting is strong enough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover the hidden pasts of residents and guests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Residents and visitors follow fixed routines\u2014appearing only at specific times and days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But your involvement may cause their behavior to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether to face their hidden pain and trauma is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiple routes, multiple endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices, rule adherence, and how you connect with others will shape the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some scenes and endings will only occur under specific conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several endings exist\u2014ranging from calm resolution to eerie revelations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Why are you in a place like this?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755820?t=1748044755","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755820?t=1748044755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755820/4728a5c7cb86fb7a54fdbf8885e7710dfde1115e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748044755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755820/4728a5c7cb86fb7a54fdbf8885e7710dfde1115e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748044755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes:\r\nPsychological horror elements\r\nDepictions of death and unsettling behavior\r\nSupernatural themes involving ghostly and unexplained events\r\n\r\nNote: This game does not contain sexual content, graphic violence, or excessive gore.\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual assault, non-consensual sex, drug abuse, or self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---</p><p 